--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6b150d71335989a41acd6479095b721b, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  entries:
  - speaker: Ren
    text: We made it...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kiri
    text: This is it...? The place where he's resting?
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: Mhm! The Malevolence's sleeping self is somewhere deep in this cavern.
      We don't have much time until he wakes up...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Rio
    text: Then we've gotta find this guy, and fast!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Right... can we get a lock on ???'s magical energy? If the Malevolence
      is somewhere here... he could lead us right to him.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Maya
    text: Nothing, as of yet. However... you are right, Ren. That man is definitely
      here somewhere...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kiri
    text: So if we find him...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Maya
    text: We find the hiding spot of the Malevolence.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kiri
    text: Finding him is gonna be easy! He's probably laid out a bunch of traps anyway...
      we just follow those and we'll get to him in no time!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Right... we need to be careful, though.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Let's move.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
